           <td style="width:54px;text-align:right;color:#999;font-size:9pt;border-left:1px dotted #bbb">14</td></tr><tr><td style="padding:5px 10px;font-size:15pt;line-height:1.9">Yo pongo la mesa con mi hermana.</td>
           <td style="width:54px;text-align:right;color:#999;font-size:9pt;border-left:1px dotted #bbb">21</td></tr><tr><td style="padding:5px 10px;font-size:15pt;line-height:1.9">Ponemos un mantel y seis vasos.</td>
           <td style="width:54px;text-align:right;color:#999;font-size:9pt;border-left:1px dotted #bbb">27</td></tr><tr><td style="padding:5px 10px;font-size:15pt;line-height:1.9">Mi tío pone música en el patio.</td>
           <td style="width:54px;text-align:right;color:#999;font-size:9pt;border-left:1px dotted #bbb">34</td></tr><tr><td style="padding:5px 10px;font-size:15pt;line-height:1.9">Todos cantamos y bailamos.</td>
           <td style="width:54px;text-align:right;color:#999;font-size:9pt;border-left:1px dotted #bbb">38</td></tr><tr><td style="padding:5px 10px;font-size:15pt;line-height:1.9">Después comemos la tarta.</td>
           <td style="width:54px;text-align:right;color:#999;font-size:9pt;border-left:1px dotted #bbb">42</td></tr><tr><td style="padding:5px 10px;font-size:15pt;line-height:1.9">¡Está muy rica!</td>
